  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification automata bind each perception outcome to a safe, progress-oriented action, enforcing conservative recovery only when needed and prioritizing forward exploration. Recovery states after obstacles allow only one-shot, directed actions, and return to exploration as soon as clearance is detected.",
